poor life habits, it is a struggle XD\nShe is an enjoyer of cheap beer and cigarettes.\n\nCan you draw her raging at a difficult videogame while streaming on her computer.  She can a few scattered beer cans nearby. Feel free to make her comically mad\n\nAnd can you draw her enthusiastically reading a cute magic-girl manga. She can laying on her belly, kicking her legs. \n\nHer room is very messy XD\n\nThanks again so much my friend!\nhttps://imgur.com/a/b16MdRD\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/b16MdRD", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@imadragon610/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 18372, "client_id": 1774222, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7ddb07a9/uploads/origins/8d32a400-457b-46ca-a405-2643e9f8897e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5680efa9352299fabb159b02fd06f40e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7ddb07a9/uploads/origins/8d32a400-457b-46ca-a405-2643e9f8897e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5680efa9352299fabb159b02fd06f40e, https://si.imgix.net/7ddb07a9/uploads/origins/8d32a400-457b-46ca-a405-2643e9f8897e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7b0db38d1770d34ad2d99964297a267 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7ddb07a9/uploads/origins/8d32a400-457b-46ca-a405-2643e9f8897e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8717e98bf577f62cfc661638c8d61133 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7ddb07a9/uploads/origins/8d32a400-457b-46ca-a405-2643e9f8897e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0df36d3b068d3e6770cee67a84ffd428", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7ddb07a9/uploads/origins/8d32a400-457b-46ca-a405-2643e9f8897e?bg=%23fff&auto=